      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 17 · AI CRM Updater\nReads call notes or email threads and pushes structured updates (stage, next step, deal value) to your CRM API.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/crm-updater` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"text\": \"Call with Priya at Globex: moving to negotiation, deal ~24k, wants to close before Dec 20. Next step: send revised quote Friday.\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
